y at some places in Central and Uva provinces and in Batticaloa and Ampara districts.\n\nSeveral spells of showers will occur in Northern province.\n\nShowers or thundershowers may occur at a few places elsewhere after 2.00 p.m.\n\nA few showers may occur in coastal areas of North-western and Western provinces."
