terly / (30-40) kmph; gusting up to 50 kmph. Other sea areas : Easterly or Variable / (30-40) kmph. State of the Sea:\n\nEQ-10N, 80E-95E : Fairly rough, rough at times. 10N-20N, 80E-95E : Moderate; Fairly rough at times.\n\nCondition of Rain:\n\nShowers will occur at several places in the sea areas off the coast extending from Kankasanthurai to Pottuvil via Trincomalee and Batticaloa.\n\nWinds:"
