ia Hambantota.\n\nState of Sea:\n\nThe sea areas off the coast extending from Chilaw to Kankasanthurai via Mannar and from Galle to Pottuvil via Hambantota will be fairly rough at times. The other sea areas around the island will be moderate.\n\nTemporarily strong gusty winds and very rough seas can be expected during thundershowers."
