    "chunk_text": "Web: www.dmc.gov.lk Email: dg@dmc.gov.lk\n\nyosis weu;=\u00ef $\n\nmtru eltbf;if miog;G\n\n/ Emergency Operations Hotline : 011 2136222/011 2670002\n\n\u0d89\u0daf\u0dd2\u0dbb\u0dd2 \u0db4\u0dd0\u0dba 36 \u0dc3\u0db3\u0dc4\u0dcf \u0dc3\u0dcf\u0db8\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dca\u200d\u0dba\u0dba \u0d9a\u0dcf\u0dbd\u0d9c\u0dd4\u0dab \u0d85\u0db1\u0dca\u200d\u0dcf\u0dc0\u0dd0\u0d9a\u0dd2\u0dba 2026 \u0db4\u0db4\u0db6\u0dbb\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0dbb\u0dd2 \u0db8\u0dc3 16 \u0daf\u0dd2\u0db1\u0dca\u200d \u0dc3\u0dc0\u0dc3 04.00 \u0da7 \u0db1\u0dd2\u0d9a\u0dd4\u0dad\u0dca \u0d9a\u0dbb\u0db1\u0dca\u200d \u0dbd\u0daf\u0dd2.\n\nGENERAL WEATHER FORECAST FOR NEXT 36 HOURS\n\nIssued at 04.00 p.m. on 16 February 2026\n\nTonight Showers or thundershowers are likely at a few places in Western and Sabaragamuwa provinces and in Galle and Matara districts. Tomorrow Showery condition is expected to enhance in Northern, Northcentral, Central, Uva and Eastern provinces in next few days from tomorrow (17th). Showers will occur at times in Northern, Northcentral, Central, Uva, Eastern provinces and in Hambantota district. Heavy falls above 100 mm are likely at some places in Central, Uva and Eastern provinces and in Polonnaruwa district. Showers or thundershowers will occur at several places elsewhere after 1.00 p.m. Fairly heavy showers about 75 mm are likely at some places. Misty conditions can be expected at some places in Northcentral, Sabaragamuwa and Central provinces and in Galle and Matara districts during the early hours of the morning. The general public is kindly requested to take adequate precautions to minimize damages caused by temporary localized strong winds and lightning during thundershowers.\n\n\u0dc1\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf\u0dc0 \u0dc3\u0db3\u0dc4\u0dcf \u0dc3\u0dcf\u0db8\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dca\u200d\u0dba\u0dba \u0d9a\u0dcf\u0dbd\u0d9c\u0dd4\u0dab \u0d85\u0db1\u0dca\u200d\u0dcf\u0dc0\u0dd0\u0d9a\u0dd2\u0dba GENERAL WEATHER FORECAST FOR SRI LANKA \u0