dd2\u0da7 \u0d91\u0db8\u0dcf \u0db8\u0dd4\u0dc4\u0dd4\u0daf\u0dd4 \u0db4\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dbd\u0dda\u0dc1\u0dca\u200d \u0dad \u0dc0\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0dbd\u0dd2\u0d9a\u0dcf\u0dc0 \u0d89\u0dad \u0dbb\u0dc5\u0dd4 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dba \u0dc4\u0dcf\u0dd0\u0d9a\u0dcf.\n\nCondition of Rain:\n\nWind speed can increase up to 40 kmph at times in the sea areas off the coast extending from Matara to Pottuvil via Hambantota. State of Sea:\n\nThe sea areas off the coast extending from Matara to Pottuvil via Hambantota will be moderate at times. The other sea areas around the island will be slight.\n\nTemporarily strong gusty winds and very rough seas can be expected during thundershowers."
