dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dda\u0dc1\u0dca\u200d\u0dc0\u0dbd\u0d82\u0da7 \u0dc4\u0dd2\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0db8\u0dd4\u0daf\u0dd4\u0db1\u0dca \u0dc0\u0db1\u0dd4 \u0d87\u0dad.\n\nWEATHER FORECAST FOR 07 APRIL 2026\n\nIssued at 05.30 a.m. on 07 April 2026.\n\nShowers or thundershowers will occur at several places in Northern, North-central, Central, Sabaragamuwa, Uva and Southern provinces after 1.00 p.m.\n\nShowers may occur in Hambanthota and Ampara districts in the morning.\n\nMisty conditions can be expected at some places in Central, Sabaragamuwa and Uva provinces and in Ampara and Polonnaruwa districts during the early hours of the morning."
