dd0\u0d9a\u0dcf.\n\nCondition of Rain:\n\nShowers or thundershowers are likely at a few places in the sea areas off the coast extending from Chilaw to Matara via Colombo and Galle.\n\nWinds: Winds will be South-westerly or variable in direction. Wind speed will be (20-30) kmph. Wind speed can increase up to (40-45) kmph at times in the sea areas off the coast extending from Galle to Pottuvil via Matara and Hambantota. State of Sea: The sea areas off the coast extending from Galle to Pottuvil via Matara and Hambantota may be fairly rough at times. The other sea areas around the island will be slight.\n\nTemporarily strong gusty winds and very rough seas can be expected during thundershowers."
