tions to minimize damages caused by temporary localized strong winds and lightning during thundershowers.\n\n\u0dc1\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf\u0dc0 \u0dc3\u0db3\u0dc4\u0dcf \u0dc3\u0dcf\u0db8\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dba\u0dba \u0d9a\u0dcf\u0dbd\u0d9c\u0dd4\u0dab \u0d85\u0db1\u0dcf\u0dc0\u0dd0\u0d9a\u0dd2\u0dba\n\nGENERAL WEATHER FORECAST FOR SRI LANKA \u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0d9a\u0dcf\u0dbd\u0d9c\u0dd4\u0dab \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0daf\u0dba\u0dcf \u0db8\u0db0\u0dca\u200d\u0dba\u0dc3\u0dca\u0dae\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dba\u0dda, \u0d85\u0db1\u0dcf\u0dc0\u0dd0\u0d9a\u0dd2 \u0d85\u0d82\u0dc1\u0dba \u0db8\u0d9c\u0dd2\u0db1\u0dca \u0db1\u0dd2\u0d9a\u0dd4\u0dad\u0dca \u0d9a\u0dbb\u0db1 \u0dbd\u0daf\u0dd2 Issued by Forecasting Division, National Meteorological Centre\n\nDate : 24-Apr-2026\n\nCity Temperature (0C) Relative Humidity (%) Weather Max Min Max Min Anuradhapura 35 25 95 55 Showers or thundershowers after 2.00p.m\n\nBatticaloa 33 26 95 70 Showers or thundershowers are likely after 2.00p.m Colombo 34 26 90 60 Showers or thundershowers are likely after 2.00p.m Galle 32 26 95 70 Showers or thundershowers after 2.00p.m Jaffna 35 27 95 55 Showers or thundershowers are likely after 2.00p.m Kandy 32 23 95 65 Showers or thundershowers after 2.00p.m Nuwara-Eliya 22 13 95 75 Showers or thundershowers after 2.00p.m Ratnapura 34 24 95 60 Showers or thundershowers after 2.00p.m Trincomalee 35 26 90 55 Mainly fair Mannar 34 27 90 55 Showers or thundershowers are likely after 2.00p.m \u0daf\u0dd2\u0db1\u0dba : 2026-04-24"
