ent of Meteorology is closely monitoring the evolution of this system. The general public is kindly requested to stay attentive to future forecasts and bulletins issued by the Department of Meteorology in this regard.\n\nDuty Meteorologist Department of meteorology 0112 686 686 (24-hour service)"
