s or thundershowers will occur in the sea areas around the island.\n\nWinds: Winds will be South-westerly and wind speed will be (25-35) kmph. Wind speed can increase up to (40-45) kmph at times in the sea areas off the coast extending from Puttalam to Kankasanthurai via Mannar and from Matara to Pottuvil via Hambantota. State of Sea: The sea areas off the coasts extending from Puttalam to Kankasanthurai via Mannar and from Matara to Pottuvil via Hambantota can be fairly rough at times. The other sea areas around the island can be moderate.\n\nTemporarily strong gusty winds and very rough seas can be expected during thundershowers."
