estern provinces Galle and\n\nMatara districts.\n\nTake action!\n\nThe prevailing Showery conditions are expected to continue further due to the low-pressure area in the vicinity of Sri Lanka.\n\nVery heavy showers above 150mm are likely at some places in Western, Sabaragamuwa, Central and North-western provinces and in Galle and Matara districts. Heavy showers about 100 mm are likely at some places elsewhere of the island."
