s. The other sea areas around the island can be moderate.\n\nThe swell waves (about 2.0 \u2013 2.5 m) height (this is not for land area) may increase in the sea areas off the coast extending from Puttam to Pottuvil via Colombo, Galle and Hambantota.\n\nTemporarily strong gusty winds and very rough seas can be expected during thundershowers."
