    "chunk_text": "==== BLOCKS ====\n\nColor: -Red Waning (Take action)\n\nColor: -Amber Advisory (Be prepared)\n\nColor: -Green Threat is over\n\nBulletin No: 01 LRW/26/05/14/01 COLOR: Red\n\nWarning for Heavy Rain Issued by the Natural Hazards Early Warning Centre Issued at 09.30 a.m. on 14 May 2026 valid for the period until 08.30 a.m. 15 May 2026\n\nFor Western, Sabaragamuwa, North-western provinces Kandy, Nuwara-Eliya,\n\nGalle and Matara districts.\n\nTake action!\n\nThe low pressure area located northeast of the Sri Lanka, still persist. this system is expected to move away from Sri Lanka and gradually weaken during the next 36 hours.\n\nHeavy showers above 100mm are likely at some places in Western, Sabaragamuwa and North-western provinces and in Kandy, Nuwara-Eliya, Galle and Matara districts. Therefore, general public is advised to take adequate precautions to minimize damages caused by heavy rain, strong winds and lightning during thundershowers. Situation: Reported rainfall (currently received) from 08.30 a.m. on 13.05.2026 to 08.30 a.m. on 14.05.2026 given below.\n\nWeather Station Districts Rainfall (mm) Puttalam Puttalam 256.2"
