    "chunk_text": "Showers or thundershowers will occur at several places in the sea areas off the coast extending from Puttalam to Hambantota via Colombo and Galle. Showers or thundershowers may occur at a few places elsewhere around the island in the evening or night.\n\nThe wave height may increase about (2.0 \u2013 3.0) meters in the sea areas off the coast extending from Mannar to Pottuvil via Puttalam, Colombo, Galle and Hambantota (this is not for land area).\n\nTemporarily strong gusty winds and very rough seas can be expected during thundershowers."
