    "chunk_text": "\u0db8\u0dd4\u0dc4\u0dd4\u0d9c\u0dda \u0dc3\u0dca\u0dc0\u0db7\u0dcf\u0dc0\u0dba: EQ -05S, 60E-100E : \u0db8\u0dd9 \u0dc0\u0dc1\u0db6\u0dba\u0db1\u0dca \u0dbb\u0dc5\u0dd4 \u0dc3\u0dd2\u0da7 \u0dad\u0dbb\u0db8\u0d9a\u0dca \u0dbb\u0dc5\u0dd4. \u0db6\u0dc3\u0dc3\u0dd4 \u0db8\u0dd4\u0dc4\u0dd4\u0daf\u0dd4 \u0db4\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0db6\u0dda\u0dc1 : \u0dc3\u0ddc\u0db8\u0ddc\u0db1\u0dba \u0dc3\u0dca\u0dc0\u0db7\u0ddc\u0dc0\u0db6\u0dda \u0dc3\u0dd2\u0da7 \u0db8\u0dd9 \u0dc0\u0dc1\u0db6\u0dba\u0db1\u0dca \u0dbb\u0dc5\u0dd4. **\u0d9c\u0dd2\u0d9c\u0dd4\u0dbb\u0dd4\u0db8\u0dca \u0dc3\u0dc4\u0dd2\u0dad \u0dc0\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0dd2 \u0d87\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0db1 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0da7 \u0dad\u0daf \u0dc3\u0dd4\u0dc5\u0dcf\u0d82 \u0dc3\u0db8\u0d9f \u0d91\u0db8 \u0db8\u0dd4\u0dc4\u0dd4\u0daf\u0dd4 \u0db4\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0d9c\u0dda\u0dc1 \u0dad\u0dcf\u0dc0\u0d9a\u0dcf\u0dbd\u0dd2\u0d9a\u0dc0 \u0d89\u0dad\u0dcf \u0dbb\u0dc5\u0dd4 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dba \u0dc4\u0dd0\u0d9a.\n\nPage 1 of 2\n\nWeather forecast for multi-day boats For the sea areas in between 20N - 10S and 60E-100E (Issued at 07.00 a.m. on 23 May 2026, for next 24 hours)\n\nSea Areas Around the island.\n\n03N -17N, 80E-87E : Fairly rough, Rough at times. 02N -10N, 87E-100E : Moderate, fairly rough at times. Other sea areas : Moderate.\n\nCondition of Rain:\n\nShowers or thundershowers will occur at several places in the sea areas off the coast extending from Puttalam to Hambantota via Colombo and Galle. Showers or thundershowers may occur at a few places elsewhere around the island in the evening or night.\n\nWinds: Winds will be southwesterly. Wind speed will be (30-40) kmph. Wind speed can increase up to (50-60) kmph at times in the sea areas off the coast extending from Puttalam to Pottuvil via Colombo, Galle and Hambantota. Wind speed can increase up to 50 kmph at times in the other sea areas around the island. State of Sea: The sea areas off the coasts extending from Puttalam to Pottuvil via Colombo, Galle and Hambantota will be rough at times. The other sea areas around the island will be fairly rough at times.\n\nThe wave height may increase about (2.0 \u2013 3.0) meters in the sea areas off the coast extending from Puttalam to Pottuvil via Colombo, Galle and Hambantota (this is not for land area).\n\nTemporarily strong gusty winds and very rough seas can be expected during thundershowers.\n\nPage 2 of 2\n\nArabian Sea"
